@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@loanId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Informasi API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Daftar peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans

### Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?status=Terlambat&page=1&limit=20

### Buat peminjaman, lalu ganti loanId di atas dengan data.id dari response
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_code": "AGT-001",
  "member_name": "Nadia Contoh",
  "book_code": "BK-001",
  "book_title": "Belajar REST API",
  "loan_date": "2026-10-01",
  "due_date": "2026-10-08"
}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}

### Ganti seluruh data
PUT {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_code": "AGT-001",
  "member_name": "Nadia Contoh",
  "book_code": "BK-001",
  "book_title": "Belajar REST API",
  "loan_date": "2026-10-01",
  "due_date": "2026-10-10",
  "status": "Terlambat"
}

### Kembalikan buku
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Dikembalikan",
  "return_date": "2026-10-06"
}

### Hapus peminjaman
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
